msgstr "Spil fra Epic og GOG"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7412
msgid ""
"In Heroic, choose Windows games as the folder when you install one, and Windows plays it too: Epic's launcher there takes it over, and GOG's games start by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Vælg \"Windows games\" som mappe i Heroic, når du installerer et spil, så spiller Windows det også: Epics launcher dér overtager det, og GOG-spil starter af sig selv."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7419
msgid ""
"Get Heroic for your Epic and GOG games. One you install in Windows games plays in Windows too."
msgstr ""
"Hent Heroic til dine Epic- og GOG-spil. Et spil, du installerer i \"Windows games\", kører også i Windows."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7422
msgid "Getting Heroic…"
msgstr "Henter Heroic…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7422
msgid "Get Heroic"
msgstr "Hent Heroic"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7437
