msgstr "Spil fra Battle.net, Ubisoft og EA"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7438
msgid ""
"In Battle.net, Ubisoft Connect or the EA app here, install to drive W: (Windows games), and Windows plays it too. The first time, its launcher there may ask where it is: Play says what to pick."
msgstr ""
"Installér til drev W: (Windows-spil) i Battle.net, Ubisoft Connect eller EA-appen her, så spiller Windows det også. Første gang spørger launcheren dér måske, hvor det er: Spil fortæller, hvad du skal vælge."

